# Dark Legacy at Prog 3 without the formula: Cochal-Monchal's trigger is nil (his default 696); then, the formula given by
# GM, Raibaht's 755 with a full inventory (the Raven Scythe does not fit: not completed, the formula kept), and again with
# room (completed).
lists Metalworks/Raibaht/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Cochal-Monchal/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/755
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-50.9,-6.25,109.3 job=DRK lvl=40
quest Bastok.DarkLegacy accepted
charvar Quest[1][57]Prog 3
login
trigger Cochal-Monchal               # Prog 3, no formula: nil, his default 696
finish-if-event
keyitem DarksteelFormula
warp -26.3,-10,-2.1 Metalworks
fill-inventory
trigger Raibaht                      # the formula: 755
finish                               # the inventory full: not completed, the formula kept
free-inventory
trigger Raibaht                      # 755 again
finish                               # completed: Raven Scythe, fame +20, the formula deleted
